Cell["\<\
The purpose of this MICA Module is to define Wiener systems and introduce \
techniques which under certain circumstances enables Wiener systems to be \
characterized experimentally.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.783699896829513*^9, 3.783699993001296*^9}, {
