Cell["\<\
In this MICA Notebook we will simulate a Wiener system and attempt to \
discover, h(\[Tau]) and n(\[CenterDot]) purely from the input, x(t), and \
output, y(t), data sets.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7837001774699593`*^9, 3.783700645586067*^9}, {
   3.783712731510212*^9, 3.783712788064506*^9}, 3.783719425377431*^9, {
