Cell["\<\
If we inverse Laplace transform this transfer function then we get:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.773056482754692*^9, 
  3.773056522787628*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e61ba903-9904-4a68-b93f-\
