Cell["\<\
Notice that we only used odd powers in this polynomial fit. The reasoning \
behind this will be explained in subsequent MICA notebooks.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7840509805770054`*^9, 
  3.7840510325392528`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"95cbbad2-fceb-423b-8038-\
6ed2cbc8382e"],

Cell["\<\
Lets plot this estimate, n1(\[CenterDot]), of the nonlinearity together with \
the cross-plot of u1(t) vs y(t):\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.783718675464451*^9, 3.783718706893976*^9}, {
  3.783768741616623*^9, 3.783768749179517*^9}, {3.7838923005098767`*^9, 
  3.78389231160559*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4d59afff-ced3-43ae-b53a-\
1d3aa95b3410"],

