Cell["\<\
Our initial estimates are clearly off. Lets estimate the three parameters \
using our trusty Levenberg-Marquardt nonlinear minimization technique:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.784035997514586*^9, 
  3.784036056732134*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"15f762c2-ea54-484b-93c1-\
5263f462f8f4"],

