Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Conclusion", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7840354531093245`*^9, 3.7840355424065657`*^9}, {
  3.7840363404367247`*^9, 3.784036383543155*^9}, {3.7840365500870476`*^9, 
  3.784036570988723*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"81bd5c4c-0718-4e7c-bf7a-\
15f7c7ec191d"],

Cell["\<\
In conclusion we have managed to identify both the linear dynamic part and \
the static nonlinear part of the the Wiener system. 
The Wiener system has been identified both non-parametrically and \
parametrically!!

\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7840354531093245`*^9, 3.7840355424065657`*^9}, {
  3.7840363404367247`*^9, 3.784036383543155*^9}, {3.7840365500870476`*^9, 
